      },
      "message": "feat(post): probe programs report the measured deviation on the control\n\nThe Tormach PathPilot post writes (DEBUG, PROBE <axis> ERROR #19n) per\nprobed axis after its tolerance test and before the G10 L20 offset write\n(or the measure-only MSG/M0 stop): LinuxCNC's DEBUG comment shows in the\nstatus display without stopping and substitutes #n. The Fanuc-family\npost records that macro B has no non-stopping display (#3000 alarms,\n#3006 stops) and writes nothing. Sinumerik (MSG) and Heidenhain (none\nconfirmed) are recorded for when their probe hooks land.\n\nFixes #575\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
